s": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. with acc. of extent, λίμνη . . μέγαθος, ὅσηπερ ἡ ἐν Δήλῳ in size as large as that in Delos,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 2.170", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "175", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 423b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". with Adjs. expressing Quantity, etc., both words being put in the same case, [πίθηκοι] ἄφθονοι ὅσοι . . γίνονται, i. e. in amazing numbers,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 4.194", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ὄχλος ὑπερφυὴς ὅσος prodigiously large,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Pl. 750", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "χρήματα θαυμαστὰ ὅσα Pl. Hp.Ma. 282c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "025", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Luc. Halc. 5", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0061", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. ; ἀπλάτων ὅσων, ἀμύθητα ὅσα,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Phld. Rh. 1.3", "author_abbreviation": "Phld.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "91", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S.", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Corn. ND 9", "aut